---
number: 457
title: Look All Around You
author: Carrie E. E. Breck
composer: Charles H. Gabriel
sp_category: "28"
topic: The Gospel Commission
notes: "AUTO: chorus detected heuristically — verify"
---

[verse 1]
Look all around you, find someone in need,
Help somebody today!
Tho’ it be little a neighborly deed
Help somebody today!

[chorus]
Help somebody today,
Somebody along life’s way;
Let sorrow be ended,
The friendless befriended,
Oh, help somebody today!

[verse 2]
Many are waiting a kind, loving word,
Help somebody today!
Thou hast a message, O let it be heard,
Help somebody today!

[chorus]
Help somebody today,
Somebody along life’s way;
Let sorrow be ended,
The friendless befriended,
Oh, help somebody today!

[verse 3]
Many have burdens too heavy to bear,
Help somebody today!
Grief is the portion of some ev’rywhere,
Help somebody today!

[chorus]
Help somebody today,
Somebody along life’s way;
Let sorrow be ended,
The friendless befriended,
Oh, help somebody today!

[verse 4]
Some are discouraged and weary in heart,
Help somebody today!
Someone the journey to Heaven should start,
Help somebody today!

[chorus]
Help somebody today,
Somebody along life’s way;
Let sorrow be ended,
The friendless befriended,
Oh, help somebody today!
